#chip 16F1829, 8

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): three small WaitL1 delays inside the loop body on 16F1829
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 40,000 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit
Dim Flag As Bit
Dim X As Byte
Repeat For 20 ms
    WaitL1 3 us
    WaitL1 6 us
    WaitL1 9 us
End Repeat
Do
Loop
